  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Assistance, Shelter Innovation, Water Harvesting and Accelerated Education for Displacement-Affected Communities in Cabo Delgado</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRC will support displacement-affected communities in Cabo Delgado through legal assistance and civil documentation, HLP protection, climate-resilient shelter prototyping, household rainwater harvesting, and Accelerated Education Programming. The project will prioritise vulnerable IDPs, returnees and host communities, while strengthening local systems, community-based response capacity, and coordinated humanitarian action.</narrative>
  </description>
